@* カレンダー凡例コンポーネント *@

<div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm border border-base-300">
    <div class="card-body p-4 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="card-title text-sm">凡例</h3>

        @* 充足率と色の対応 *@
        <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-base-content/70">充足率</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded" style="background-color: #3b82f6;"></div>
                    <span>空き(0%)</span>
                </div>
                <span>→</span>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded" style="background-color: #22d3ee;"></div>
                    <span>少(~30%)</span>
                </div>
                <span>→</span>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded" style="background-color: #facc15;"></div>
                    <span>中(~70%)</span>
                </div>
                <span>→</span>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded" style="background-color: #f97316;"></div>
                    <span>多(~100%)</span>
                </div>
                <span>→</span>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded" style="background-color: #ef4444;"></div>
                    <span>満(100%)</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        @* 状態表示 *@
        <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-base-content/70">状態</div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded bg-base-300 opacity-60"></div>
                    <span>フィルター非該当</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded border-2 border-blue-500"></div>
                    <span>選択中</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded border-2 border-green-500"></div>
                    <span>今日</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        @* 操作方法 *@
        <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-base-content/70">操作方法</div>
            <div class="space-y-0.5 text-xs text-base-content/80">
                <div><span class="font-medium">クリック:</span> 期間の開始日を設定</div>
                <div><span class="font-medium">Shift+クリック:</span> 期間の終了日を設定</div>
                <div><span class="font-medium">ドラッグ:</span> 範囲選択</div>
                <div><span class="font-medium">ダブルクリック:</span> その日の詳細を表示</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        @* グラフの説明 *@
        <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-base-content/70">グラフ</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-base-content/80">
                各セルの棒グラフは時間帯ごとの予約充足率を表示します。棒の高さが充足率、色が混雑度を示します。
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

